     The range for "natural" luck, where you aren't carrying
any luck conferring items, is -10 to +10.  With one or more
such items, that range becomes -13 to +13.  [It's actually
either -13 to +7 or -7 to +13 at any given time, depending
upon the number of cursed luck items being carried versus
the number of non-cursed ones.]

     The minimum and maximum values are never affected by
date or phase of moon.  Date and moon affect whether the
equilibrium state for timed-out luck is -1 or +1 instead of
the normal 0, but it doesn't change the range.  The source
code has a couple of comments (and a bogus prayer case)
suggesting otherwise, but they're wrong.


